:General
     Thió  seô oæ routineó provideó simplå I/Ï  capabilitieó 
witè  absolutelù nï sidå effectó oî anù  registers®   Direcô 
BIOÓ  calló arå useä oî alì routineó excepô foò  BIN¬  BIST¬ 
anä BOUT¬  sï functionó sucè aó ^Ğ (whicè arå implementeä bù 
thå BDOS© wilì noô worë by-and-large.

     Thå  seô oæ I/Ï capabilitieó provideä bù theså routineó 
includes:
          Character Input from Console and Reader
          Character Output to Console, Printer, and Punch
          Character Output to Console, Printer, and Punch
               with Control-Character Processing
          Console Input Status
          Conditional Input
          New Line (CRLF) Output
